# Pairs with AliasOwnershipPreserved. A derived copy inherits its source's owner; judging the copy's own ledger
# row lets an unowned alias reach an app's data.
MODULE: AppsAliasIgnoresDerivation
TARGET: AliasOwnershipPreserved
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the guard judges the target's own owner, not its derivation root's
PERTURBS: SetAlias

--- FIND
    LET root == Root(p)
--- REPLACE
    LET root == p
--- END
